        <mxCell id="flow" value="1. UI invoke logs_open&#xa;2. Rust responde window_id&#xa;3. Rust emit logs_status(following)&#xa;4. Rust emit logs_chunk (N veces)&#xa;5. UI invoke analyze_write_group (opcional)&#xa;6. UI invoke logs_close" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#64748B;fontColor=#0F172A;align=left;spacingLeft=10;fontSize=12;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
